cmd-playmapsound-desc = Plays a sound for all players on the specified map.
cmd-playmapsound-help = Usage: playmapsound <sound path> [map ID] [volume]. Without a map ID the sound plays on your current map.
cmd-playmapsound-arg-map = [map ID]
cmd-playmapsound-no-map = Specify a map ID.
cmd-playmapsound-map-not-found = Map { $map } not found.
cmd-playmapsound-success = Sound played on map { $map } for players: { $players }
cmd-playmapsound-success-empty = Sound played on map { $map }, but there are no players there.
